This repository holds tools that build an executable for FNV (PC, version 1.4.0.525) from the source code in
fnv_decomp and the user's own copy of the game. The program is the copyrighted work of its owners, and nothing in this
repository grants any rights in it. The contributors do not grant a licence to their own contributions either. You may
view this repository and fork it on GitHub as GitHub's Terms of Service allow.

